watch` and `watch_from` sentence, above main's restructured notes through `replay_continue_fairly` (86a34a680); `FIELDS_WITHOUT_A_LEGACY_KEY` 47, forty-six fewer, so thirty-two keys fewer, `assert keys.len() + 32`; `test.cli_on_host` adds the four watch tests as 670 on main's lines, and the pin prose starts from main's counts. fb39308d1: the global RPC revision commit is regenerated on top as revision 20 (digest d229c7947838bf88, main's Resources digest f013e36743d8d9e6), after the test-filter fix. Main's 5d111b3ec lists `test.regular_crates_on_host` twice; each commit here that moves it sets the first entry equal to the second, under a \"Kept equal to the second test.regular_crates_on_host entry below\" line. 2aaa02b46's `test.detcore_unit` pins carry #4739's added non-leader exec unit: 3263 + 6 = 3269 in both cells. Pins (main's value plus this change's tests, each matching `cargo nextest list`): `test.cli` 747 → 751, `test.cli_on_host` 666 → 670, `test.detcore_unit` and `_on_host` 3005 → 3269, `test.hermit_unit` 1280 → 1291, `test.hermit_unit_on_host` 1274 → 1285, `test.regular_crates` 1929 → 1934, `test.regular_crates_on_host` 1915 → 1920. `ci/sync-cell-config.sh --check`, fmt and `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings` are clean. Re-run at the new head (AMD host): `-p hermit-detcore --lib`: 3269 of 3269 passed; `-p hermit-run --lib` `watch_is_refused_where_it_could_not_arm_or_report`: 1 of 1 passed; `-p hermit-run --test cli` 4 named tests: 4 of 4 passed; `-p detcore-model --lib` `a_watch_takes_an_address_a_length_and_an_access`, `config_fingerprint_includes_the_watch_element_layout`: 2 of 2 passed; `-p hermit-lit-guests --test lit`: 91 of 96 passed; the other 4 fail the same way at main `286901287` on this host: `every_lit_fixture_is_a_case_or_waits_for_its_guest`, `every_lit_fixture_is_within_the_supported_subset` (main's lit inventory does not list the `fifo_jump_replay` fixture main added, https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/issues/5000, fixe